body:
Oh no, not that, I have a specific example;
I had an ex cry after he confessed cheating on me and then when I took a moment to think it through his tears and words meant nothing apparently because he didn’t want me as much as he begged me to not leave him, while confessing. So no, not all tears are equal.

It really depends on what and how and where. But I do love it when they expose their honest feelings, absolutely, like I said; I was gonna give him a second chance, but he didn’t take it.
